{"id":"2c-t-x","name":"2C-T-x","form":"capsule","status":"Documented","aliases":"","category":"Other","summarySources":"PsychonautWiki","summary":"2C-T-x is a documented other compound on PsychonautWiki.","doseMaxTick":100,"doseUnit":"mg","doseRows":[],"durationRows":[],"subjectiveEffects":[],"combinations":[],"citations":[],"helpfulLinks":[{"title":"PsychonautWiki","description":"Pharmacology, subjective effects, and routes","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/2C-T-x"},{"title":"維基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/2%2C5-%E4%BA%8C%E7%94%B2%E6%B0%A7%E5%9F%BA%E8%8B%AF%E4%B9%99%E8%83%BA%E8%A1%8D%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9"}],"summaryZh":"2,5-二甲氧基苯乙胺衍生物，也稱為2C類化合物（英語：2C-x）或2C家族（英語：2C family）是苯乙胺衍生物中甲氧基苯乙胺衍生物的一類，苯基上2號位與5號位的氫被甲氧基取代，即以2,5-二甲氧基苯乙胺（也稱為2C-H）為母結構，其中絕大多數的取代基位於4號位，少數位於3號位，6號位基本上沒有取代基。"}